light.deliveredText:
If Priya signs off and the sandbox test passes, here's the rollout checklist:
- copy the customer settings without copying their API keys;
- switch the test group to the new endpoint;
- ask Owen to watch the error rate for twenty minutes.

If either condition fails, do none of those things. Existing customers outside the test group should stay on the old endpoint either way.

